-- The car_listings_*_trgm_idx indexes are intentionally NOT dropped here.
-- Prisma's schema DSL can't express a GIN/gin_trgm_ops index, so every
-- `migrate dev` diff against the live database proposes dropping these four
-- hand-added indexes (see 20260829180601_add_search_indexes/migration.sql's
-- own comment) even though nothing about them actually changed. Removed
-- from the autogenerated diff so this migration only does what its name
-- says — add the mobile_refresh_tokens table — and doesn't regress ILIKE
-- search performance on make/model/title/location.

